# How to calculate “prize vs effort”

Do **not** use:

```text
prize / estimated_hours
```

It ignores probability and costs.

Use:

```text
Expected Gross Payout
=
Σ P(outcome_i) × payout_i
```

Then:

```text
Expected Net Value
=
expected_gross_payout
-
entry_fee
-
gas
-
compute
-
API_cost
-
infrastructure
-
expected_rework_cost
-
capital_risk_cost
-
human_intervention_cost
```

For one-off bounty:

```text
EV =
P(award)
× P(accept | award)
× payout
-
costs
```

For competition:

```text
EV =
Σ P(rank=r) × prize(r)
-
costs
```

For emissions:

```text
EV_7d =
Σ predicted_reward_share(day)
× reward_pool(day)
-
7d_costs
```

For x402/service:

```text
EV_30d =
predicted_calls_30d
× (price - variable_cost)
-
fixed_deployment_cost
```

