# Human intervention should have its own taxonomy

I'd implement:

| Level  | Meaning                                               |
| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| **H0** | Fully autonomous after secrets are provisioned        |
| **H1** | One-time human setup; thereafter autonomous           |
| **H2** | Human approval required per opportunity               |
| **H3** | Human contributes materially to producing deliverable |
| **H4** | Fundamentally human-only                              |

